Project edai1_silver {
  database_type: 'Delta Lake (Spark 3.5)'
  Note: 'Observed from rehearsal-5gb-v1, benchmark ab-20261110225456, profile optimized (silver run ab-20261110225456-optimized-silver-r261110225457); source manifest ac2dfb0eac16. Ref `>` = many-to-one, `-` = one-to-one; every Ref note names the executed validator rule.'
